  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n60% of G = (4)/(5) of H\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n60% of G = (4)/(5) of H\n\n⇒ (3)/(5) of G = (4)/(5) of H\n\n⇒ 3G = 4H\n\n⇒ G/H = 4/3\n\nNow,\n\n% = (4/3) × 100\n\n⇒ 133.33%\n\n**∴ The required answer is 133.33%.**",
